  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure 3: overall qualitative evaluation. Six bars per team — P@5, R@5, F1@5 and the averages over k = 5, 10, 15, 20 of precision, recall and F1 — for thirteen teams, ordered left to right by average recall@k rather than alphabetically: DNB-AI-Project, DUTIR831, RUC Team, Annif, Jim, icip, TartuNLP, LA²I²F, NBF, Homa, last_minute, YNU-HPCC, TSOTSALAB. The y-axis runs 0 to 0.6 and every bar is labelled. DNB-AI-Project leads with P@5 0.53 and Avg. R@k 0.51; DUTIR831 follows at 0.49 / 0.49 and RUC Team at 0.48 / 0.46. TSOTSALAB is last at about 0.04 across the board. Avg. R@k exceeds P@5 for the mid-table teams, which is what a recall measure over a larger k does. silp_nlp, present in Figures 1, 2 and 4, does not appear here.",
